@startuml diagram_03_sequence_mission_validation
title Mission Validation Flow (multi-strategy)

actor Player
actor GameMaker
participant MissionDetailPopup as "MissionDetailPopup"
participant ValidationDisplay as "ValidationDisplay\n(gmApprove / qr only)"
participant upsertProgressEvent as "Use Case: upsertProgressEvent"
participant PBAdapter as "PocketBase Adapter"
participant PocketBase

Player -> MissionDetailPopup : Clicks mission (text or link type)
MissionDetailPopup -> MissionDetailPopup : Renders detail popup\nwith action button

note over MissionDetailPopup : Reads mission.validationMethod\nand routes to correct strategy on action click

== Strategy: gmApprove ==

Player -> MissionDetailPopup : "Mark Complete"
MissionDetailPopup -> upsertProgressEvent : {playerId, missionId,\nstatus: 'pendingApproval'}
upsertProgressEvent -> PBAdapter : query progress_events WHERE playerId & missionId
PBAdapter -> PocketBase : GET progress_events filter
PocketBase --> PBAdapter : existing record or empty

alt record exists
    PBAdapter -> PocketBase : PATCH record with status: pendingApproval
else no record
    PBAdapter -> PocketBase : POST new ProgressEvent
end

MissionDetailPopup -> ValidationDisplay : setShowValidation(true)\nmounts PendingApprovalDisplay
note over ValidationDisplay : Subscribes to SSE via\nadapter.subscribeProgressEvent(playerId, missionId)
ValidationDisplay -> PBAdapter : subscribeProgressEvent(playerId, missionId, callback)
PBAdapter -> PocketBase : SSE subscription for ProgressEvent changes

GameMaker -> PocketBase : Opens PendingApprovalsPanel in AdminCockpitPage
note over GameMaker : Sees ApprovalRequestCard\nfor each pendingApproval event

GameMaker -> upsertProgressEvent : {playerId, missionId,\nstatus: 'completed', validatedBy}
upsertProgressEvent -> PBAdapter : PATCH progress_events
PBAdapter -> PocketBase : update record
PocketBase --> ValidationDisplay : SSE fires callback with status: completed
ValidationDisplay -> MissionDetailPopup : onValidated()
MissionDetailPopup -> MissionDetailPopup : Dismiss popup → computeProgress

== Strategy: selfApprove ==

Player -> MissionDetailPopup : "Mark Complete"
MissionDetailPopup -> upsertProgressEvent : {playerId, missionId,\nstatus: 'autoApproved'}
upsertProgressEvent -> PBAdapter : POST/PATCH progress_events
PBAdapter -> PocketBase : write record
note over ValidationDisplay : No ValidationDisplay mounts\nfor selfApprove — immediate dismiss
MissionDetailPopup -> MissionDetailPopup : Dismiss immediately → computeProgress

== Strategy: qr (offline — physical co-location required) ==

note over MissionDetailPopup
  Player side: NO PB write.
  Just shows QRDisplay + subscribes to SSE for GM completion.
  Per C-07: only the GameMaker writes via ValidationPage after scanning.
end note

Player -> MissionDetailPopup : "Mark Complete"
MissionDetailPopup -> ValidationDisplay : setShowValidation(true)\nmounts QRDisplay
note over ValidationDisplay : Subscribes to SSE for\nGM completion events (not player-initiated)
ValidationDisplay -> PBAdapter : subscribeProgressEvent(playerId, missionId, callback)

ValidationDisplay -> ValidationDisplay : Render QRDisplay component\n(encoded payload as QR image)
note over GameMaker : Opens QRScannerPage on their device\nor uses in-page AdminQRScannerModal

GameMaker -> GameMaker : Camera decodes raw QR string

participant qrPayloadUtil as "qrPayload.ts (util)"

GameMaker -> qrPayloadUtil : decode(rawQrString)
qrPayloadUtil -> qrPayloadUtil : parse JSON payload
qrPayloadUtil -> qrPayloadUtil : recompute HMAC from sessionToken
qrPayloadUtil -> qrPayloadUtil : compare recomputed vs payload.hmac

alt HMAC valid and issuedAt within tolerance
    qrPayloadUtil --> GameMaker : ScanData { playerId, missionId, xpValue, ... }
    GameMaker -> GameMaker : Render ValidationResult\n(player name, mission, XP)
    
    participant ValidationPage as "ValidationPage (/validate/:sid?t=)"
    
    GameMaker -> ValidationPage : navigate to /validate/<sessionId>?t=<token>
    ValidationPage -> ValidationPage : decodeQRPayload(token, session.qrSecret)
    ValidationPage -> ValidationPage : verify payload.sessionId === route sessionId
    
    ValidationPage -> PBAdapter : getPlayerById(payload.playerId)
    PBAdapter -> PocketBase : GET player by ID
    PocketBase --> PBAdapter : Player record
    
    ValidationPage -> PBAdapter : listProgressEvents(playerId)
    PBAdapter -> PocketBase : GET progress_events filter
    PocketBase --> PBAdapter : existing record or empty
    
    alt record exists (already completed)
        note over ValidationPage : Shows "Already Completed" indicator
    else no record
        ValidationPage -> upsertProgressEvent : {playerId, missionId,\nstatus: 'completed', validatedBy}
        upsertProgressEvent -> PBAdapter : POST new ProgressEvent
        PBAdapter -> PocketBase : write record
    end
    
    ValidationPage -> MissionDetailPopup : navigate(replace) back to cockpit\nSSE fires onValidated() callback
else HMAC invalid or payload expired
    qrPayloadUtil --> GameMaker : ValidationError
    GameMaker -> GameMaker : Render error state in ValidationResult
end

== Strategy: form (always autoApproved — C-06) ==

note over MissionDetailPopup
  Form missions are always autoApproved regardless of validationMethod.
  ValidationDisplay never mounts for type: "form".
  Player navigates to /form/:missionId instead.
end note

Player -> MissionDetailPopup : Clicks FORM mission (not completed)
MissionDetailPopup -> MissionDetailPopup : Navigate to FormPage (/form/:mid)
note over FormPage : Renders dynamic fields from FieldSchema[]\nsubmits with status: "autoApproved" + formResponse

@enduml
